OL,3,AHe left 28 years ago, now after 36,000
OL,4,Amiles Karl Bushby is almost home
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith his journey almost complete, Karl
OL,7,FBushby reflects on adventures that have
OL,8,Ftaken him across four continents, as
OL,9,Fwell as strained relationships and how
OL,10,Flife as he knows it is about to change
OL,11,Fdramatically.
OL,13,FBack in 1998, the former paratrooper,
OL,14,Fthen aged 29, set off from Punta
OL,15,FArenas, Chile, to walk an unbroken path
OL,16,Fto his home city of Hull, without
OL,17,Fbreaking two self-imposed rules: not to
OL,18,Freturn to the UK until he had completed
OL,19,Fhis journey, and not to use transport
OL,20,Fto advance.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
