OL,3,AHe left 28 years ago, now after 36,000
OL,4,Amiles Karl Bushby is almost home
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow 57, he is embarking on his final
OL,7,Ffew miles having hacked his way through
OL,8,Fthe jungles of the Darien Gap, crossed
OL,9,Fthe frozen Bering Strait and, just a
OL,10,Ffew weeks ago, swum the English
OL,11,FChannel.
OL,13,FAt the end, he will be met by his
OL,14,F36-year-old son Adam, a 12-year-old
OL,15,Fgranddaughter whom he has never met,
OL,16,Fhis father and brothers. His mother
OL,17,Fwill be waiting at his childhood home
OL,18,Fthat he left 28 years ago.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
